   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "君の弾丸ラブをスマートに駆使し、どれだけ君が異世界の彼らを愛しているかをシューティングで思い知らせてやろう!<br />\n<br />\n一たびモンスターたちがエンジェルガールに接触すれば、彼らからのラブ攻撃が彼女に!<br />\n<br />\n25の異なったエッチアニメとモンスターとのエッチシーンが、彼女が何度か負かされたのち閲覧出来ます。(ズームフィーチャー及び女のコの着せ替え機能あり)<br />\n<br />\n* 無料体験版をぜひお試しください!<br />\n*もしゲームをお気に召していただけたら、ぜひPatreonへ遊びに来てください! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Octopussy\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/Octopussy</a><br />\n<br />\n<br />\nYou must give as much love as possible to beings of different worlds by shooting them! <br />\n<br />\nUse your bullets of love wisely! ^~ But if the monsters reach the angel girl, they will give love to her too!<br />\n<br />\n~ Game have 25 different sex animations And after beating monsters for few times you can watch sex scenes with them into gallery (with zooming feature and easily swapping across the few costumes for the girl) <br />\n<br />\n* There's a free playable trial, please definitely give it a try!! <br />\n<br />\n* Also if you like the game you can support us at patreon! ^^ <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Octopussy\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/Octopussy</a>"
    }
   ]
